{
 "note": "Busselton Pioneer Cemetery (the Old Busselton Cemetery, 1847, State Register), Marine Tce, Stanley St and Adelaide St. From the Landgate aerial (Oct 2026), the OSM boundary (way 588019005) and the City's photos of the 2023 works. A low dark steel fence on the three street sides, a grey Colorbond fence to the caravan park and the house lot cut out of the north-east corner, the entrance at the Stanley St and Adelaide St corner (limestone pillars, a pair of steel gates, a paved path with red brick edging and the grey name-tablet panels either side), and about ninety graves in the clusters the aerial shows, as low blocks: marble headstones, white crosses, kerbed plots and ledger slabs. No lettered sign: the name on site isn't known. Metres: x along Marine Tce, left to right as seen from it (east to west), y south from the Marine Tce boundary.",
